    'transit'=> '<p>WeGo Public Transit runs Nashville&rsquo;s buses and the WeGo Star commuter train from Lebanon into downtown. Outside the urban core, Nashville is quite car-dependent, and traffic on the interstates can be heavy at rush hour.</p><p>Nashville International Airport (BNA) is about 15 minutes east of downtown by car.</p>',
