    'transit'=> '<p>Hampton Roads Transit runs buses in Virginia Beach and the surrounding cities, and its Tide light rail operates in neighboring Norfolk. For most residents, though, Virginia Beach is car-dependent, and tunnel and bridge traffic across the region can be heavy.</p><p>Norfolk International Airport (ORF) is next to the Virginia Beach city line and is the main airport for the area.</p>',
