      ['q' => 'Do I need a car in Raleigh?', 'a' => 'For most people, yes. Bus service exists, but the region is spread out.'],
      ['q' => 'Is it easy to find a sublet near NC State?', 'a' => 'Summer is the best time, as many students leave and sublet their rooms.'],
    ],
  ],

  'ok/oklahoma-city' => [
