    'transit'=> '<p>TARC (Transit Authority of River City) runs Louisville&rsquo;s buses. Most residents drive, and the interstates make it easy to get around the metro.</p><p>Louisville Muhammad Ali International Airport (SDF) is just south of downtown, around 10 to 15 minutes by car.</p>',
    'tips' => [
