    'transit'=> '<p>The Utah Transit Authority (UTA) runs TRAX light rail, the FrontRunner commuter train along the Wasatch Front, the S-Line streetcar and buses. TRAX connects downtown with the University of Utah and the airport.</p><p>Salt Lake City International Airport (SLC) is just west of downtown and reachable by TRAX&rsquo;s Green Line.</p>',
